<title>JAPAN: Kitano clarifies 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kitano clarifies 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Operating	    1.10		vs	    1.23</p>
<p>NOTE - Kitano Construction Corp announced its half-year</p>
<p>earnings on November 8 but it incorrectly annouced at</p>
<p>that time that its interim operating profit in the six</p>
<p>months to September 30, 1995 was 1.29 billion yen.</p>
</text>
